# Intellectia API

> Reverse-engineered internal API. Unofficial — may change without notice.

## Documentation Index
- `SKILL.md` (this file)
- `references/REFERENCE.md` (detailed endpoint docs)
- `references/ENDPOINTS.json` (machine-readable endpoint catalog)
- `scripts/api.ts` (typed client interface)

## Authentication
Bearer Token — Authentication method detected from captured traffic.

### Providing credentials
- Prefer passing auth as request headers or cookies at call time (do not hardcode secrets into the skill).
- If executing via an external proxy/executor, pass per-call credentials (cookies and/or headers) so they are not persisted.

## Dependencies
- Runtime capable of HTTPS requests.
- If using `scripts/api.ts`: TypeScript toolchain (or transpile to JS).

## Endpoints

### Auth Flow (1)
- `GET /gateway/v1/finance/{financeToken}` — Authenticate and retrieve a finance token.

### Data Read (23)
- `GET /{id}` — Retrieve data for a specific ID.
- `GET /{id}/{id}` — Fetch data for a specific item using two IDs.
- `GET /chat/{chatId}` — Retrieve a specific chat conversation.
- `GET /community-screener-plaza/{community-screener-plazaId}` — Get details for a community screener plaza.
- `GET /gateway/v1/{v1Id}` — Get data associated with a specific V1 ID.
- `GET /gateway/v1/{v1Id}/hot-markets` — Get a list of hot markets for a given ID.
- `GET /gateway/v1/blog/list` — Get a list of blog posts.
- `GET /gateway/v1/campaign/ads/list` — List advertisements for a campaign.
- `GET /gateway/v1/discover/theme-list` — Retrieve a list of available themes.
- `GET /gateway/v1/homepage/onboarding/data` — Get onboarding data for the homepage.
- `GET /gateway/v1/news/flash` — Get the latest flash news updates.
- `GET /gateway/v1/push/robot/status` — Check the status of a push robot.
- `GET /gateway/v1/rbac/quota` — Check the current API usage quota.
- `GET /gateway/v1/stock/{stockId}` — Get detailed information about a specific stock.
- `GET /gateway/v1/stock/swing-max/list` — Get a list of swing-max stocks.
- `GET /gateway/v1/stock/whales/{whaleId}` — Get data about a specific whale investor.
- `GET /gateway/v1/subscription/coupon-codes` — Retrieve available subscription coupon codes.
- `GET /news/{newId}` — Retrieve a specific news article.
- `GET /news/stock/{stockId}` — Retrieve news articles related to a specific stock.
- `GET /popup-intellectia/builder` — Get the popup intellectia builder configuration.
